{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01EkDedxsHqKjSbhYBnbVc1y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented and verified. Final state: **1254 tests passing** (1145 engine regression tests untouched and green, plus FDN reference tests and 63 new SOS tests), all 13 TODO items checked off, working tree committed — one commit per card plus one for the shared engine seams.\n\n**What was built:**\n\n- **Shared seams (E1–E3):** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from both `cast_spell` and `cast_spell_free` (free casts are still casts; copies correctly aren't), a new `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from `advance_phase` after mana pools empty, and `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents.\n- **The ten cards**, each in its own `card_impl.py` with 4–11 real-engine tests, mirroring the nearest FDN analogue.\n\n**Notable findings where the engine contradicted the plan** (all logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`):\n- `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined and used by five FDN cards but **never fired** — sos_1 needed it, so combat now fires it after attackers are declared.\n- Self-ETB triggers never fire through the real cast path (the engine fires the ETB event before registering the entering card's triggers — fdn_136's trigger is dead code through `cast_spell`). sos_13 works around this card-locally by pushing its enter trigger from `register_triggers`.\n- Loyalty abilities had **no target plumbing** despite the TODO describing it as existing — added an optional `targets` field to `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` that sets `chosen_targets` the same way spells do.\n\n**Spec-over-plan deviations:** sos_13's prepared copy is created at prepare time and cast *paying* its {W} cost (rule 722.3c in the rulebook, vs. TODO's free-cast-on-elect), and sos_57's \"if you control a Wizard\" is checked at resolution rather than at delayed-trigger time, per official wording conventions.\n\n**Small additive engine extensions** (all justified by a single card, none renamed/moved anything): restricted mana bucket in `ManaPool` with a `spell=` kwarg on `can_pay`/`pay` (sos_257), `card.mana_spent` recorded at cast (sos_57), replacement-effect consultation for stack→graveyard moves via `SpellGoesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (sos_1), and `GameState.rng` + `Player.skip_turns` with skip handling in turn rotation (sos_97)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":288558,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":769},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98b35815-b35f-4b80-bf9f-66c04f25a22f","uuid":"379f1d5a-eac3-4c75-b06d-f24ad3b7432d","request_id":"req_011CbwLzAgR4BfK32rKVV96t"}
